    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 mischievous cats are hiding and it\u2019s your mission to find them all. Search every corner, solve light puzzles, and bring each scene to life by coloring it in a calm and relaxing environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT YOU\u2019LL LOVE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully hand-drawn map full of detail and charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax by coloring with guided numbers or a free color palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 hidden cats to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite a friend to join your search through online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light lo-fi music and ambient sounds to enhance your creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your art in the community gallery, vote for others, and join monthly contests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-use controls, adjustable zoom, and color-blind-friendly palettes make it accessible to everyone.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 mischievous cats are hiding and it\u2019s your mission to find them all. Search every corner, solve light puzzles, and bring each scene to life by coloring it in a calm and relaxing environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT YOU\u2019LL LOVE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully hand-drawn map full of detail and charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax by coloring with guided numbers or a free color palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 hidden cats to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite a friend to join your search through online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light lo-fi music and ambient sounds to enhance your creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your art in the community gallery, vote for others, and join monthly contests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-use controls, adjustable zoom, and color-blind-friendly palettes make it accessible to everyone.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Grab your crayons and hunt for 100 hidden cats across a beautifully hand-drawn map. Play solo or invite a friend to join online, then bring each scene to life with guided color-by-numbers or your own palette \u2014 all in a relaxing, soothing atmosphere.",
